AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> :MATSUS_0000058 "Qualitative estimates are allowed. A quantitative risk estimate may additionally be typed as assessment result datum or indicator result when warranted; no disjointness is asserted."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(:integrationBasis :MATSUS_0000058 "SRC-005 risk branch and process/result distinction; final human decision 5.")
AnnotationAssertion(:integrationMethod :MATSUS_0000058 "MatSus-local class using the pinned PMDco/IAO/OBI backbone; no exact external class mapping was found")
AnnotationAssertion(:integrationNote :MATSUS_0000058 "SSbD risk-assessment candidates denote processes, not this result; the absence of a mappedTo annotation is deliberate.")
