AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> :MATSUS_0000077 "Relates assessment result information to other assessment result information to whose represented result it contributes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> :MATSUS_0000077 "This relation does not assert parthood, arithmetic summation, exhaustive coverage, or transitivity."@en)
